@Back_End_HostAddress = http://localhost:5280
@matchId = match_example
@unknownMatchId = unknown_match
@accessToken = replace-with-participant-access-token

GET {{Back_End_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a persisted match result (requires a participant JWT)
GET {{Back_End_HostAddress}}/api/matches/{{matchId}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### A match without a persisted result returns 404
GET {{Back_End_HostAddress}}/api/matches/{{unknownMatchId}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
